<title>UK: LME copper slightly firmer, spreads buoyant in AM.</title>
<headline>LME copper slightly firmer, spreads buoyant in AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Slightly higher after stocks fall 1,550 tonnes, spreads still buoyant. Cash/threes at $210/$215 back vs 198/$203.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Also touch firmer, straddling $1,600 after stocks fall 2,600 tonnes.</p>
<p>ZINC - Little changed despite stocks rise of 2,775 tonnes.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Barely moved.</p>
</text>
